case matters                   -> no match
(?i) ignores case              -> at 4, "HELLO"
F_ICASE does the same          -> at 4, "HELLO"
(?i:...) for part only         -> at 0, "hello"
... the rest is exact          -> no match
. stops at a newline           -> no match
(?s) lets . cross it           -> at 0, "a\nb"
F_DOTALL does too              -> at 0, "a\nb"
(?m) with $                    -> at 10, "34"
without (?m)                   -> no match
(?=px) positive look-ahead     -> at 5, "24"
(?!px) negative look-ahead     -> at 5, "20"
